<title>USA: US Stockpile delays nickel bid to Dec 13.</title>
<headline>US Stockpile delays nickel bid to Dec 13.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center said Thursday that its next bid opening for surplus nickel has been postponed to Friday, December 13.</p>
<p>The offering was originally scheduled for Thursday, December 12.</p>
